Responsive-Bench Data License
=============================

The Responsive-Bench data (the contents of dataset/, stress_test/, and
human_study/ in this repository) is made available under the Open Data Commons
Attribution License (ODC-By) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

You are free to share, create, and adapt the data, provided that you attribute
it as described below and keep this notice with any public use or
redistribution of the data or of works produced from it.

Attribution
-----------

Responsive-Bench is derived from the Sketch2Code dataset, which is itself
licensed under ODC-By v1.0:

    Ryan Li, Yanzhe Zhang, and Diyi Yang. Sketch2Code: Evaluating
    Vision-Language Models for Interactive Web Design Prototyping. NAACL 2025.
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/SALT-NLP/Sketch2Code

Sketch2Code pairs its sketches with webpages from the Design2Code benchmark:

    Chenglei Si, Yanzhe Zhang, Ryan Li, Zhengyuan Yang, Ruibo Liu, and Diyi
    Yang. Design2Code: Benchmarking Multimodal Code Generation for Automated
    Front-End Engineering. arXiv:2403.03163, 2024.

Material reused from Sketch2Code / Design2Code:
  - dataset/sketches/*-d-v2.png   desktop sketches
  - dataset/source_html/          original reference HTML
  - rick.jpg                      placeholder image

Material added by Responsive-Bench:
  - dataset/sketches/*-m-v2.png   mobile sketches
  - dataset/references/, dataset/layout_similarity_study/
                                  augmented and reconstructed HTML
  - dataset/metadata/             per-sample metadata
  - stress_test/                  non-responsive stress-test pages
  - human_study/                  pseudonymized human ratings

When using Responsive-Bench, please cite both Responsive-Bench and Sketch2Code.
